Description: make the window resizable
 The window can be resized and gets a title. The size of the drawable area
 is checked every frame, and the viewport and the aspect ratio uniform of
 the fragment shader follow it. Resize events alone are not enough: when
 the intro starts in fullscreen, SDL2 creates the window directly at the
 desktop size and sends no event, so the image was not centered.
